{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>【Now新聞台】居屋今日(10月21日)開始揀樓，今期居屋提供約七千個單位，包括啟德啟陽苑。另外，立法會會議將會討論大學校園出入管制措施，以及規管外傭過度借貸等議題。</p><p>採訪日誌｜居屋開始揀樓／立法會討論規管外傭過度借貸等議題</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T23:38:40.180725+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T23:27:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T23:37:37.599047+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T23:37:37.599047+00:00","content_hash":"f09a94a6aac583fcf564c2c604a1ddb1783f45480e67f2c9c61981de6526b782","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}